## Последний milestone в main

Phase 19 Doc02 audit recovery **K2 PASS** (PR #84): fresh ABBA gives 1ch 50.0
fps and 3ch 50.0/50.0/50.0, worst paired uplift 1.5748× with zero
late/drop/flush/unlock. PR7 AVX2, PR8 dirty/cache/ownership and PR9 allowlist
hardening are implemented. Global flag stays OFF; opt-in is the explicit
template-id allowlist. Final 15m 1ch and 60m 3ch soaks pass at 50.0 fps with
zero DeckLink delivery errors.

This is a throughput and delivery-health result, not a subjective visual-pacing
sign-off. Visual runs on 2026-08-09 exposed bursty render delivery and visible
judder despite those averages; Phase 20 owns the proof and remediation.

## Следующие задачи

- Phase 20 P20.0/P20.1 — establish semantic frame/field evidence and an
  operator-correlated hitch detector before changing pacing.
- Phase 20 P20.2 — validate SDI cadence with a reference-preserving Quad 2
  loopback; do not infer on-wire temporal order from averages.
- Phase 20 P20.3–P20.5 — run one-factor cadence A/B, then isolate residual
  microfreezes and complete 1ch/3ch visual soaks.

## Как обновлять этот файл

При закрытии фазы N:
1. Добавить/обновить `docs/development-phases/phase-NN-*.md`
2. Строку в таблице выше → DONE + ссылка
3. PR с тегом `[Phase N]` в title

